**Minimize**

$$
28\, (x_{1,1} + x_{2,1} + x_{3,1} + x_{4,1})
+ 45\, (x_{1,2} + x_{2,2} + x_{3,2})
+ 60\, (x_{1,3} + x_{2,3})
+ 73\, x_{1,4}
$$

**subject to**

$$
x_{1,1} + x_{1,2} + x_{1,3} + x_{1,4} \geq 1500 
\quad (\text{month 1})
$$

$$
x_{1,2} + x_{1,3} + x_{1,4} + x_{2,1} + x_{2,2} + x_{2,3} \geq 1000 
\quad (\text{month 2})
